r, gold, black, and dusty pinks.\n\nPlease draw freely. You can change his clothing. Thank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/14507183.cassius-caro/gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MakotoHasuha/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/04d6081d/uploads/origins/594d1b88-c8a1-4af6-ad3f-cde0c06c7f6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bbf6cb27286f4ae1032a6062a28b819", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04d6081d/uploads/origins/594d1b88-c8a1-4af6-ad3f-cde0c06c7f6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bbf6cb27286f4ae1032a6062a28b819, https://si.imgix.net/04d6081d/uploads/origins/594d1b88-c8a1-4af6-ad3f-cde0c06c7f6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=462dfa4267f1fb733c164a752ecf0c3e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04d6081d/uploads/origins/594d1b88-c8a1-4af6-ad3f-cde0c06c7f6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ecc0107cf1092be44c916668784b95f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\nあなたのアートスタイルが大好きで、私のVTuber/OCであるセバスチャンに依頼できないかと考えています。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JOxe4vqpNiuZZD9gLGureSKE87nVyHUQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MakotoHasuha/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f16d8a1/uploads/origins/c4ed2a71-f1ec-4fcf-b1c2-2cd8cd4639f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8961792bdb9aa1969a80e6e07360860", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f16d8a1/uploads/origins/c4ed2a71-f1ec-4fcf-b1c2-2cd8cd4639f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8961792bdb9aa1969a80e6e07360860, https://si.imgix.net/7f16d8a1/uploads/origins/c4ed2a71-f1ec-4fcf-b1c2-2cd8cd4639f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd3a57adca17d8a281f90bf606d66549 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f16d8a1/uploads/origins/c4